{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>温嵐14日因腹部劇痛、發燒不退又全身無力送醫急救，一度敗血性休克，至今已經第13天。</p><p>如今好消息傳來，温嵐已經脫離險境，轉入一般病房。</p><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐14日因腹部劇痛、發燒不退又全身無力送醫急救，26日經理人聲明表示已經脫離險境，轉入一般病房。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223512/org/b7c0207d001759d7bde4f3affceb3740.jpg/614RzYzXsUL_m71RZ5PoluNY6SoVBTkBUMToflDE6H4\"/><figcaption>溫嵐14日因腹部劇痛、發燒不退又全身無力送醫急救，26日經理人聲明表示已經脫離險境，轉入一般病房。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><p>更多溫嵐照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"經理人發文表示溫嵐已脫離險境，但病容憔悴仍在插管。（FB@温嵐landy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135941813887176704849102.jpeg/Kby9B_oacC_rLHK2jaREUU2sy2QiJIaged1MkXndTJE\"/><figcaption>經理人發文表示溫嵐已脫離險境，但病容憔悴仍在插管。（FB@温嵐landy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"經理人發文表示溫嵐已脫離險境。（FB@温嵐landy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135941811756339200901357.jpeg/dcLsvCLaSSKb2HT-r8vOOb5fuQPWH-tNuWXbq7ll26s\"/><figcaption>經理人發文表示溫嵐已脫離險境。（FB@温嵐landy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐（FB@温嵐landy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135948065631375360462598.jpeg/Z5DffvXvHen1wyMH-MJMVYsQehjcVNOiCg-SyQoPksk\"/><figcaption>溫嵐（FB@温嵐landy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐與吳宗憲合唱的《屋頂》傳唱度很高。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223513/org/651ced1b96b96bf13105a3dc3f6bec68.jpg/-O-tM0rpxjze4PwbHVIGcupCE7W6iosQxM6WucTOlrk\"/><figcaption>溫嵐與吳宗憲合唱的《屋頂》傳唱度很高。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐都算保養得宜。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223515/org/1404d1d993304cf1e6e16112ec876993.jpg/VvDsMwyi0Qgh8shV-wg1V9G95P7F6aYvMjRx5DI0ceQ\"/><figcaption>溫嵐都算保養得宜。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐（IG@landywen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131966153044791296843561.jpeg/G3e43BS2wwPL3yq86BOCAgeJ2uB9s74j2eHpVdnh6VU\"/><figcaption>溫嵐（IG@landywen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐（IG@landywen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131966155280486400652890.jpeg/R98wXDVwO1dd65pEB24WLmc0U2PuScV2vBg4PrwYOD4\"/><figcaption>溫嵐（IG@landywen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223517/org/14f178cb8af7ba6be82235e2e594f312.jpg/Y0cybMxdcwKQeMg21xnbWQHEvKFq6aa8ggWXRIIFl0Q\"/><figcaption>（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐曾擔任杜德偉演唱會嘉賓。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223516/org/3e657e3308b37a6905f8784493cc6c29.jpg/NXdn-NNUp6oMgYSy24ArgRxSLTAPrPe6u6Fg17uhYNc\"/><figcaption>溫嵐曾擔任杜德偉演唱會嘉賓。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫嵐現在多數在內地發展。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4223514/org/b714fa03ee69bb472d3f763bb3671cdb.jpg/rO3Tlr-vFGxKBQxwPCLvCFz84Z3K_DcRyqjH4cqox-E\"/><figcaption>溫嵐現在多數在內地發展。（微博@溫嵐LANDY）</figcaption></figure><p>經紀人26日聲明表示，温嵐此次是：</p><p>聲明中指出「感謝北醫的團隊、拚命的温嵐，終於消滅了萬惡的結石。另外，歌迷的關心、吳克群的集氣、徐若瑄的雞精、憲哥的關懷，吳亦帆及男友雷諾第一時間送醫、還有各界好友們的慰問，温嵐與我銘感五內，待恢復後再好好與大家致謝！因避免打擾其他病房的病患休息，住院這段期間，請大家持續以訊息代替探視關心她」。</p><p>而工作方面，「預計9月可以回到舞台上再與大家見面，至於因生病延期的上海、廣州、成都演唱會，若一切順利，計劃將延至12月，感謝大家關心！」</p><p>【延伸閱讀】金馬影帝李康生驚傳胸部不適　心臟急動刀　病床照公開網民齊集氣（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】金馬影帝李康生驚傳胸部不適　心臟急動刀　病床照公開網民齊集氣（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431974492999680795208.jpeg/oLzRNKKL6oAMfT8tKy0626Au3XeM_Op67uyVQO7slUA\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】金馬影帝李康生驚傳胸部不適　心臟急動刀　病床照公開網民齊集氣（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"57歲「金馬影帝」李康生5月21日驚傳住院動刀，導演蔡明亮稍早在Facebook公開李康生病床照。（Facebook@蔡明亮Tsai Ming Liang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431090300162048265093.png/GTYyU5dNzs28mj4_kv9svn1JKgKPTK7xai6q62ouqus\"/><figcaption>57歲「金馬影帝」李康生5月21日驚傳住院動刀，導演蔡明亮稍早在Facebook公開李康生病床照。（Facebook@蔡明亮Tsai Ming Liang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不久後，蔡明亮再度更新近況，曬出李康生術後在病床上比yeah的照片，開心透露手術順利結束。（Facebook@蔡明亮Tsai Ming Liang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134432297399881728682514.jpeg/QuwUMeJn4F3Pti4L7ZSEXh909SKUODFaYiGLimIhi4o\"/><figcaption>不久後，蔡明亮再度更新近況，曬出李康生術後在病床上比yeah的照片，開心透露手術順利結束。（Facebook@蔡明亮Tsai Ming Liang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金馬影帝李康生憑《默視錄》於亞洲電影大獎奪得「最佳男配角」。（莫匡堯　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250317/978118245301096448142389.jpeg/Ha1gIv11hHEk6bdZm5as92rR-z7udOTSrffrr5f3668\"/><figcaption>金馬影帝李康生憑《默視錄》於亞洲電影大獎奪得「最佳男配角」。（莫匡堯　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431976678363136526079.jpeg/Zo-orE73G0z6Omy5FzsAdpw1YeaXTNedgICnuICAp7g\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431978968584192692107.jpeg/wnpUnGPsICUFRUmr9SZ2CcZ8bH5qqYWuf8BggX_AYIE\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431981355274240794802.jpeg/2w9HZkVgKrvFfWpQlSRxZGHgB3gSRqcaN8LBJTfCwSU\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431983825850368532647.jpeg/aFqQjFcSa_khTsks2YrPiuuui8OFyrzn_WBeDv1gXg4\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431973226319872634081.jpeg/2eeE5qXX75-_mgEvj6eu4Gp7n70RY7b9EzrgexM64Hs\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134431975944359936019564.jpeg/1QbYqlAvaD-14OPqMfph0mlg-jKHKydC_VNp6P1Taeg\"/><figcaption>李康生（Instagram@likangsheng）</figcaption></figure><p>温嵐口誤「戀愛腦」竟成真實夢靨！慘被劈腿男折磨1整年近況曝光</p><p>48歲侯佩岑精緻臉龐遭質疑「醫美」 網驚呼：撞臉宋慧喬、伊能靜</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-26T06:58:58.063883+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1147,"images":21,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}